{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10641010","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10641010","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1064101001:0":{"text":"Today's prayer ends here. May Dura's Divine Light shine on you always.","source_cn":"今日祷告至此结束。愿艾雅的圣光永远照耀着你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41010F04FF841E1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1064101002:1":{"text":"Dura above. Your words have brought us peace.","source_cn":"艾雅在上，感谢您的布道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A4243B0D5A5A671","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064101003:1":{"text":"It's getting late. Let's head home.","source_cn":"时间不早了。咱们也回家吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80369649DD6983A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064101004:1":{"text":"Alright. Kirako, make sure you say goodbye.","source_cn":"好。吉拉科，记得要和修士修女们告别哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EC61B2A21A1C313","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064101005:1":{"text":"I know, Mom!","source_cn":"放心吧，妈妈，我记着呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58DD18EFBCFD4EF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064101006:0":{"text":"Acolyte Contag, Ada, bye-bye!","source_cn":"康塔格修士，艾达姐姐，再见！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC5B155C93C02FEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064101007:1":{"text":"Goodbye, Kirako.","source_cn":"再见，吉拉科。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1717C15173CCFD7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064101008:1":{"text":"Lively and lovely as ever, that one.","source_cn":"吉拉科还是那么有活力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C94CBE00F242AAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064101009:1":{"text":"Heh. Peace like this doesn't happen by chance. Ensar's been kept under Dura's light, and the Temple's care.","source_cn":"呵呵，恩莎村能拥有这样和平宁静的时光，都是仰赖女神与圣...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BEB6982AB81A3FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064101010:1":{"text":"Ada, have you noticed? Even a remote village like ours has had new faces coming in. Could be merchants, looking to trade.","source_cn":"艾达修女，你没有发现吗？连我们这样偏僻的小村庄，最近都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x158392307204598A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064101011:1":{"text":"Is that so?","source_cn":"真的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC4A8D7276C25F12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064101012:1":{"text":"Naturally. Ever since the Second Divine War, we haven't had new settlers in ages.","source_cn":"当然。自从第二次神魔大战结束，已经接近十年没有外来者来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90DDF5D7FEE31374","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064101013:0":{"text":"Dura above. Please watch over Ensar and bless us with prosperity.","source_cn":"艾雅在上，愿您永远庇佑恩莎村，让这里更加繁荣一些吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45693C4A73E3D0D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064101014:0":{"text":"Dura above...","source_cn":"艾雅在上……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91E6FD2946C50DBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064101015:1":{"text":"Ada, you've been distracted all evening. Something happened?","source_cn":"艾达修女，你一直心不在焉。出什么事了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6102E54C155B009A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064101016:1":{"text":"I heard... there've been a lot of outsiders in the village lately.","source_cn":"我听说……最近有很多生面孔来到了村里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x117688AB4FA1211E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064101017:1":{"text":"Could it mean war again, somewhere maybe? What if another Divine War is coming?","source_cn":"路易莎修女，会不会是哪里又发生了战争？就像十年前的神魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0953285390664DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064101018:1":{"text":"I can't rule that out, I'm afraid.","source_cn":"的确有这样的可能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE25FB1CBECE345B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064101019:1":{"text":"I know how you feel, Ada. That war left you with scars that don't fade easily.","source_cn":"我明白你的担忧，艾达修女。十年前的战争，给你留下了可怕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0F2036BED1E92B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064101020:1":{"text":"But look, war hasn't reached Ensar. It's likely only a minor riot in the neighboring towns, if anything. It'll settle soon, so don't let fear take root.","source_cn":"但你看，没有战火蔓延到恩莎村，很可能只是临近的村镇发生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90E757E0E251E94A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064101021:1":{"text":"I know... It's just... I'm worried refugees might bring danger to Ensar with them.","source_cn":"我明白……我只是担心，战争难民逃亡过来，会不会给恩莎村...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51255F1EDE34B317","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064101022:1":{"text":"Don't worry. We'll find a way to protect anyone who seeks the temple's assistance.","source_cn":"呵呵，不用担心。如果难民向教堂求助，我们自然有办法提供庇护。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB83C8F58CB95E31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1064101023:0":{"text":"Even that unremarkable cabinet proved its worth. Ten years ago, it hid someone from an enemy search.","source_cn":"比如，那只最不起眼的橱柜。十年前，就曾有人藏在里面躲避...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9D24C0AC784DD30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:32::0":{"text":"Cabinet","source_cn":"橱柜","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FEF9F894DC6E389","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064101024:0":{"text":"The one that barely fits two sacks of grain? It's so cramped. How could anyone hide in there?","source_cn":"那个只能勉强装入两袋麦谷的小橱柜吗？里面那么狭窄，难民...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0124E174E1C2ABDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064101025:1":{"text":"In the face of death, something in us awakens.","source_cn":"在求生时，人的潜能是无限的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x770BFDA41940EBD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064101026:1":{"text":"Even with two sacks in there, one can wedge themselves into the space that's left when it comes to it.","source_cn":"当危机真正来临，即使橱柜里已经装进了两袋麦谷，难民也能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5C5BC490F494B99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1064101027:1":{"text":"I'll show you every shelter in the temple. Age is catching up with me. It's only a matter of time before you and Acolyte Contag take over.","source_cn":"之后，我会将教堂内的藏身之处都告诉你。我的年纪愈发大了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CB4D1088B6480BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064101028:1":{"text":"Remember Dura's teachings. Remember the Temple's most sacred creed: to give shelter to those who suffer.","source_cn":"你们要铭记女神的教导，铭记圣堂最重要的教义：为遭受磨难...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD9C16102AA5F179","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064101029:1":{"text":"I'll bear that in mind. Thank you.","source_cn":"谢谢您的教导，我记住了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2E6C29101D4317A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064101030:1":{"text":"I will offer shelter to any refugee who comes to us with an open heart and gratitude to Dura, and I will pray for her grace.","source_cn":"如果遇到战争难民，我会怀着对艾雅女神的感恩之心庇护他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59179D8F6FD634C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1064101031:1":{"text":"Good.","source_cn":"呵呵，那便好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CC82D5712B97DAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064101032:1":{"text":"Night has fallen. Eat something, then have a good night's rest.","source_cn":"夜幕已经降临。用完晚餐就回房休息吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27DA58E1D3933ACD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064101033:1":{"text":"Worry not. Dura will always keep the faithful safe.","source_cn":"无需再担忧，艾雅女神会永远庇护着祂虔诚的信徒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66D0115F883CFBEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:45:1064101034:0":{"text":"As the night grows darker, Ada drifts to sleep with gratitude.","source_cn":"夜色愈深，艾达怀着感恩之心渐渐入睡","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4D9D0BEAEC11B04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:46:1064101035:0":{"text":"...until the next morning, when a scream shatters Ensar's peace.","source_cn":"直到第二天清晨，一道哭喊划破了恩莎村的宁静","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4B0D42D1437A0C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064101036:1":{"text":"H-Help! Anyone? Please help my dad! *Crying*","source_cn":"救、救命！救救……救救我爸爸！呜呜呜——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F3F69FD602F7AC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064101037:1":{"text":"Dura above! What happened, Kirako?","source_cn":"艾雅在上！吉拉科，发生了什么事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6F9E2E18157CD39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064101038:1":{"text":"My dad... He... blood... everywhere... Bad guy...","source_cn":"爸爸……爸爸他……血……好多血……坏人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B9CF2D3D76CBA21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1064101039:0":{"text":"Easy, boy. Take a deep breath. What happened to your father? And the bad guy?","source_cn":"好孩子，别哭，慢慢说。你爸爸怎么了，哪里有坏人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x462CC6DA7FD93B45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064101040:1":{"text":"Someone... broke into our house. Dad tried to protect me and Mom, and then... then...","source_cn":"有、坏人……闯进了我家。爸爸想保护我和妈妈……然后就、就……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4035C2EC7D5E8DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064101041:1":{"text":"Can't believe you're all... gone.","source_cn":"呜呜呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x563C2E2053EDBE89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1064101042:0":{"text":"Who is that bad guy? An outsider?","source_cn":"坏人？！是谁？从哪里来的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81C98C4D1A4A13F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064101043:0":{"text":"Ada, not now! Go get hemostatic potions. We're going to the Lero house!","source_cn":"艾达修女！现在不是说这些的时候！快拿上止血的药剂，我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC07B82009796DE73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064101044:1":{"text":"R-Right! I'll be right back.","source_cn":"好……好的，我这就去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5880A93B2C9161F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:修士康塔格":{"text":"Acolyte Contag","source":"修士康塔格","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:信徒们":{"text":"Devotees","source":"信徒们","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:列罗":{"text":"Lero","source":"列罗","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃米妮":{"text":"Eminie","source":"埃米妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:吉拉科":{"text":"Kirako","source":"吉拉科","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:修女艾达":{"text":"Acolyte Ada","source":"修女艾达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:修女路易莎":{"text":"Acolyte Louisa","source":"修女路易莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏文字":{"text":"Black Screen Text","source":"黑屏文字","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":46,"localized_text_count":45,"speaker_count":8}}